WEBVTT

00:07:27.333 --> 00:07:30.833
And I couldn't continue this any longer
for my own mental health.

00:07:32.375 --> 00:07:34.042
But what could I do?

00:07:35.875 --> 00:07:39.958
Maybe, I thought, if I spoke out,

00:07:41.333 --> 00:07:43.726
I could reclaim my name,

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:47.309
and I could rewrite my narrative
on my own terms.

00:07:47.333 --> 00:07:49.434
Maybe if I spoke out,

00:07:49.458 --> 00:07:51.792
I could raise awareness about this.

00:07:52.625 --> 00:07:56.208
Maybe I could even try to change the law.

00:07:57.500 --> 00:07:58.750
And so I did.